; depth.journal — fixture for LK-COMPAT-QUERY-DEPTH-001 /
; LK-COMPAT-QUERY-DEPTH-STATS-001 / LK-COMPAT-QUERY-PRINT-INTEGRATION-001
; (Stage C Phase 5 addendum) independent re-verification, added by
; compat-differential-tester, 2026-09-17.
;
; Deliberately includes:
;   - accounts at depth 2 through 4 (equity:opening-balances /
;     expenses:transport / income:salary = 2; assets:bank:checking /
;     assets:savings:main / expenses:food:groceries = 3;
;     expenses:food:takeaway:delivery = 4)
;   - a regex-collision pair under the same "assets" parent:
;     "assets" matches both assets:bank:checking and assets:savings:main
;     (parent-level match), while "savings" matches ONLY
;     assets:savings:main, at a deeper/more specific component, and does
;     NOT match any strict ancestor of it (i.e. "assets" alone does not
;     contain "savings") -- exercises depth:assets=1 depth:savings=2
;     specificity precedence
;   - a branch (expenses:food:*) where a custom depth on "expenses" and
;     the general depth can meaningfully differ from a shallower branch
;     (expenses:transport)

